23. RESULT FREEZE PROCEDURE
======================================================================

Before manuscript submission, the following sequence must be completed:

STEP 1
Recover or recreate the authoritative patient-level computational outputs.

STEP 2
Verify each output against the Stage 3 verification registry.

STEP 3
Create the machine-readable master simulation result dataset.

STEP 4
Calculate group-level statistics directly from patient-level data.

STEP 5
Freeze the result dataset.

STEP 6
Generate manuscript tables from the frozen dataset.

STEP 7
Generate manuscript figures from the frozen dataset.

STEP 8
Cross-check every figure against the corresponding table.

STEP 9
Cross-check manuscript Results text against the frozen dataset.

STEP 10
Record the final result-dataset version in the repository.

STEP 11
Do not modify numerical manuscript values independently after the
result freeze.

Any post-freeze numerical modification requires a documented revision
and regeneration of affected figures/tables.

